<view class="page">
  <view class="title">节律训练</view>
  <view class="subtitle">
    容忍窗 {{tolMs}}ms ｜Stage1：固定BPM｜Stage2：连续 60s，不分 round；按 10 个系统 beat 做 block + 固定 70 计算 delta
  </view>

  <view class="topBpmCard" wx:if="{{mode==='stage1'}}">
    <view class="topBpmHeader">
      <view class="topBpmTitle">Stage 1 固定节奏</view>
      <view class="topBpmBadge {{stage1BpmUnlocked ? 'unlocked' : 'locked'}}">{{stage1BpmUnlocked ? '已解锁' : '未解锁'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="topBpmValue">{{bpm}} BPM</view>
    <slider
      min="{{stage1BpmMin}}"
      max="{{stage1BpmMax}}"
      step="1"
      value="{{bpm}}"
      bindchange="onBpmChange"
      disabled="{{isRunning || !stage1BpmUnlocked}}"
    />
    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{stage1BpmUnlocked}}">已解锁后可为 Stage 1 选择固定 BPM；开始训练后会锁定当前值，整轮保持固定节奏。</view>
    <view class="tip" wx:else>先按当前默认节奏完成一次 Stage 1；解锁后，这里会开放可选固定 BPM。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="modeRow">
    <button class="modeBtn {{mode==='stage1'?'active':''}}" bindtap="setMode" data-mode="stage1" disabled="{{isRunning}}">Stage 1</button>
    <button class="modeBtn {{mode==='stage2'?'active':''}}" bindtap="setMode" data-mode="stage2" disabled="{{isRunning}}">Stage 2</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage1'}}">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="label">当前固定 BPM：{{bpm}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{stage1BpmUnlocked}}">顶部滑条只作用于 Stage 1，当前这一轮会按 {{bpm}} BPM 固定运行。</view>
      <view class="tip" wx:else>当前 Stage 1 仍按默认固定节奏运行；通过后会解锁顶部的固定 BPM 选择。</view>
      <view class="tip">60 秒一轮，命中率 ≥ 70% 解锁 Stage2</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage2'}}">
      <view class="row stage2TopRow">
        <view class="label">bpm_base：{{bpmBase}}｜bpm_cur：{{bpmCur}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="row stage2TopRow">
        <view class="label">range：{{range}}｜delta：{{delta}}｜bpm_target：{{bpmTarget}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">
        Stage 2 为单段连续 60s 训练：中间无 round 切换、无准备 2s、无节拍重启。每 10 个系统 beat 构成 1 个 block，DDA 只改 range，不直接改 bpm_cur。
      </view>
      <view class="prepBadge">{{stage2PhaseText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="metronome">
      <view class="metronomeStage">
        <drum-character hitSeq="{{drumHitSeq}}"></drum-character>
      </view>
      <view class="hint">{{isRunning ? '跟着节拍点下面按钮' : '设置好后开始'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="btnRow">
      <button class="btn" type="primary" bindtap="onStart" disabled="{{isRunning}}">
        开始 {{durationSec}} 秒
      </button>
      <button class="btn" bindtap="onStop" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">停止</button>
    </view>

    <view class="tapArea">
      <button class="tapBtn" bindtap="onTapBeat" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">点我打拍</button>
    </view>

    <view class="stats">
      <view class="stat">剩余：{{remainingSec}}s</view>
      <view class="stat">Beats：{{beatCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat">命中：{{hitCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat">命中率：{{accuracyPct}}%</view>
      <view class="stat">最近误差：{{lastErrMs}}ms</view>
    </view>

    <view class="stats" wx:if="{{mode==='stage2'}}">
      <view class="stat">Block：{{blockIndex}}</view>
      <view class="stat">acc10：{{acc10Pct}}%</view>
      <view class="stat">mean_err(hit beats)：{{meanErr10}}ms</view>
      <view class="stat">状态：{{stage2PhaseText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="result" wx:if="{{!isRunning && hasResult}}">
      <view class="resultLine">本轮结果：命中率 {{accuracyPct}}%</view>

      <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage1'}}">
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{passed}}">
          ✅ Stage1 达标：已解锁 Stage2
        </view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{!passed}}">
          ❗未达标（需要 ≥ 70%）
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="btnRow">
        <button class="btn" bindtap="onExport" disabled="{{logCount===0}}">导出数据（复制）</button>
        <button class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空结果</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <view>Stage2 为连续 60s 单段训练；导出仍以 beat 为中心：beatIndex, roundIndex(兼容字段), blockIndex, beatTime, bpm, hit, miss, errMs, extraTapCount, bpmTarget, range, delta</view>
  </view>
</view>
